msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BBF691D3_FDBA_4A1B_B183_0D76087D0568"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Wha—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ED5421CD_2EED_4272_B8C2_B59BE897FE85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acc8214c8f994c3a5cd3749bb2494413388d1eacdcee1364a5f259479c0bd79f
#. default-sha256: c3244c6e3d00a0f64efc1ad2ab26b164bf5a2c2cecbfd81ab512a863d45fcb54
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ED5421CD_2EED_4272_B8C2_B59BE897FE85"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...What is that smell? Perfume?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……이 향은 뭐야. ⟪k:2⟫향수인가?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5F65D0CB_3C76_499E_AD53_CAB8E35B41DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61becf5d90bdaca4608e4943215796bbce30d0bd52a342bd60bba1e11cf02190
#. default-sha256: 205efb855f091b0b93c10357bc3f96b2bfbe5000232a4f9bc64dc9d0b9126ecc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5F65D0CB_3C76_499E_AD53_CAB8E35B41DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫When did you get perfume?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And I have to say, you seem to be having ⟪k:4⟫"
"quite⟪k:5⟫ the time.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Look at you—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫you’re out of breath! Red as a beet!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그런 걸 ⟪k:2⟫언제 입수했어. ⟪k:3⟫게다가―― 아주 신나 보이는데?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫숨을 다 헐떡거리"
"곤, ⟪k:6⟫응? ⟪k:7⟫뺨도 빨갛게 물들이고 말이야!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AF5CF907_8CD2_4393_B886_F00478BF0421
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f1f3ed770ef169ae497bd3415e0a89750ec89b8a25071994b9bd8a6711c79ad
#. default-sha256: 38073537c06a1dfb563feb2e1806ceac722b1b43399f2e3e1784b256de24fb81
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AF5CF907_8CD2_4393_B886_F00478BF0421"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I made the right decision coming back.⟪k:1⟫Where the ⟪k:2⟫hell⟪k:3⟫ were you going?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫돌아오길 잘했군――, ⟪k:1⟫대체 어딜 싸돌아다니려 했어!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_75005960_2805_4F07_A073_5BD75F7CA263
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82a6d0ffc30cf5db688846ab233c0694d3424a8f778873205710f51560ad9a8f
#. default-sha256: 01290b064a05ab55b84de79dca5766d759601f248f7017171650df4f2ddb6c4b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_75005960_2805_4F07_A073_5BD75F7CA263"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No! I wasn’t going..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫오해예요! ⟪k:2⟫이건……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_52D6F390_DC20_4DDF_889F_026F22311C3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f484bbf42722f4d6831c87099b262689cf6e2e827991723196faad53029b23fc
#. default-sha256: e669112a929dd401eb2bfe834f3c39be56ef6354c6b20045faacea05ed1e4bf3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52D6F390_DC20_4DDF_889F_026F22311C3B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫J-⟪k:2⟫Jacopo... ⟪k:3⟫Calm down, seriously!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫야, ⟪k:2⟫야코포……, ⟪k:3⟫너 좀, ⟪k:4⟫진정해 봐……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_86C9C9D9_0193_4F54_AEEC_2FC0D8E06EAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54868d1f5c3d6bf47676ef5e41df4784fcaa92b7fd6d7292caff74eb18b1d3e9
#. default-sha256: 06cdb2bb535cff527723d275665f4598b0b67cc82beeaafc099e0aa218b91799
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_86C9C9D9_0193_4F54_AEEC_2FC0D8E06EAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You shut it!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Now ⟪k:5⟫you’re⟪k:6⟫ taking this tramp’s side?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫닥쳐!! ⟪k:2⟫너까지 저 녀석 편을 들겠단 거야!?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_50FDFA26_9CB4_4C3F_B572_9115485FE7C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1aa2c1ebd7197c663775eea0a94a1997d6ea0092776068b3e6faeb139c6bce86
#. default-sha256: eb4c099d8dd2b4e7c1c6b4943695ca6904bad651092a0e504591d097e3754e3e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_50FDFA26_9CB4_4C3F_B572_9115485FE7C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0E06B623_797B_4A2C_A1AB_25AC1EADBEE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c87d7a4f5ad2c80b550f6afea49b316eec0c90203dd4806114e22c1b26b98c5f
#. default-sha256: 67a87fa1b5fc80e804cc96adfcf031679f800fda7e07626623b92a153220f282
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0E06B623_797B_4A2C_A1AB_25AC1EADBEE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I have told you before you are ⟪k:2⟫not⟪k:3⟫ to leave this house without first "
"consulting me! ⟪k:4⟫Or do you mean to tell me you’ve forgotten?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫내 허가도 없이 집에서 나오지 말란 말 ⟪k:2⟫못 알아들었어!?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫기억이 안 난단 소리라"
"도 하게!?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BDEE98E1_A681_4ADE_8459_143BF942CBA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 81541cac2301c1c83210e8afe07ff20fa4f8a06dcfebeaf9dfa0e35278fe82a6
#. default-sha256: 830fea4370780e8e2185f6fce8e01ab58c4a23392d758c1fd10b4281eb169186
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BDEE98E1_A681_4ADE_8459_143BF942CBA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫God, your ears aren’t just for show, all right—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫they’re better than that! They’ll "
"even throw out the parts you don’t wanna hear!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 귀는 장식이 아니라, ⟪k:1⟫듣기 싫은 건 다 거르는 모양이로구만!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_220B2CA3_E360_4C2B_9AAB_A8637608D3C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63bfa47912f5159d9fc7af18abaef3b6511fe6b06346cae14ebc7cdecb6ae8fe
#. default-sha256: 121a62bb94e3800dec90077f1683fc766a2cf3ccb6005534b1fe76b31e0d13f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_220B2CA3_E360_4C2B_9AAB_A8637608D3C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, I swear, I was not doing anything you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아니에요, ⟪k:2⟫정말로 ⟪k:3⟫당신에게 떳떳하지 못 한 짓은――!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_38AE51B4_B6ED_4722_A12E_51DA35244AA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93a24600c90febb0b2267ecc5cef4b365507e7c15734e7d4fb42f4539959255e
#. default-sha256: 73d7b85619f1e076dc972bbcedd2513a705cfb1396b759e46dde5b9cd835cd69
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38AE51B4_B6ED_4722_A12E_51DA35244AA0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Silence! I have no interest in your excuses!⟪k:2⟫You’re always watching from the "
"shadows,⟪k:3⟫observing, trying not to step on anyone’s toes..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫잔말 마! ⟪k:2⟫변명은 듣기도 싫어! ⟪k:3⟫너는 항상 ⟪k:4⟫남의 눈치를 살피듯 굴면서――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_20B7AA04_A4C6_467F_A6AD_6ECE7F691E53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50e46ef3ce7f2070f6c908ad704147210069a044ea305aba103a537b69f65ea7
#. default-sha256: eb5b9d022672609876a27c63466a48a44c732461fd05023e9c72d5f243803933
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_20B7AA04_A4C6_467F_A6AD_6ECE7F691E53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and in the back of your mind, you’re mocking me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫속으로는 ⟪k:1⟫나를 깔보고 있잖아!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E6C468E2_0B46_47EC_AC42_E06676313957
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b5d7c6a6e962ae3ca5d8b5dd71b952a262a72464dadf2a5a125781ed78fcbfc
#. default-sha256: 3c5610b943296f0114244c73c18bd96398e8276dfe285fc738a6506d9016f501
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E6C468E2_0B46_47EC_AC42_E06676313957"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, I—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아니에요………!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_191FB2B0_6141_4458_A371_C8183519C3C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22d026307a56518becfd5b2feec202166e92c8423596ef5d13d0fdc9fb2e3a44
#. default-sha256: 4379d508de5a5dcd6c45ec506e54e68c3614b30084f2b38308fb7e491a865203
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_191FB2B0_6141_4458_A371_C8183519C3C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Listen up and listen good!⟪k:2⟫You just ⟪k:3⟫try⟪k:4⟫ stepping out of line again!⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫You just ⟪k:7⟫try⟪k:8⟫ disgracing me again!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫잘 들어, ⟪k:2⟫이 이상 방자하게 굴기라도 하면! ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫내 체면에―― 먹칠을 하면 말이다!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_21FE0FD0_961A_485F_B7C3_E41FC7C47088
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c438d006ed8c63b96afd9646486e1e9c2825cb44033e89b158dfc8352a6e13c0
#. default-sha256: bc676bfefa07180be01b767ebb02ccdd982777403cab85f6d21e6393b03952d8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_21FE0FD0_961A_485F_B7C3_E41FC7C47088"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You will not get away with it!⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫너를 가만 안 둘 줄 알아……!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2EA643C4_C256_4FCA_8325_9B6A5DC497D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc84f79ad8b90a9f30fabff6e54dcf7444f1f989f58baed3b2783bcbcd7c660e
#. default-sha256: 2bf0ea6aa3c4527027e168a28f339cf100e6c24c254ac3e7f2d794d415bcecc6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2EA643C4_C256_4FCA_8325_9B6A5DC497D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9CA88EC_3D49_44B5_B9E7_506745E5DBC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d8da337b848b4611dfb3e3d5e934b5b2dc06e6b891373386dba8fa033330c3d
#. default-sha256: 0f90c383f12a0db35137d781c2294fe7278af83712ef04d17ff003e4be2fd237
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9CA88EC_3D49_44B5_B9E7_506745E5DBC3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For the love of god...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Get back to your room, now!⟪k:4⟫You too, Maria!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……개같은, ⟪k:2⟫속이 뒤틀리는군……!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫얼른 방으로 돌아가! ⟪k:5⟫너도, ⟪k:6⟫마리아!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D63885EF_3312_40B5_BC25_952D45482760
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
